# The Game Corner's clerk (decomp scripts_game_corner.s GameCorner_CoinsClerk): with the Coin Case, the coin and money
# windows, 50 coins for $1000 and 500 for $10000 (check_can_add_coins, add_coins, update_coin_display), then NO THANKS.
# A streak of ten bonus rounds (check_bonus_round_streak over VAR_CONSECUTIVE_BONUS_ROUND_WINS) earns TM64 first.
give item platinum:ITEM_COIN_CASE
give money 20000
set var platinum:VAR_CONSECUTIVE_BONUS_ROUND_WINS 10
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_GAME_CORNER 5 10 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 5 6 6000
+0 release up
+0 press left
until position 2 6 6000
+0 release left
until idle
+0 press up
+1 release up
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 900
until idle 600
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_RECEIVED_GAME_CORNER_TM64 true
+0 assert state bag.tmhms[item="platinum:ITEM_TM64"].count 1
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
+0 assert state coins 0
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
+0 assert state coins 50
+0 assert state money 22000
+4 press down
+1 release down
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
+0 assert state coins 550
+0 assert state money 12000
+4 press down
+1 release down
+4 press down
+1 release down
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until idle 600
+0 assert state coins 550
